WEBVTT

00:00.610 --> 00:02.310
It's impossible.

00:02.310 --> 00:05.020
I can't become one of the Midarezaki.

00:05.020 --> 00:07.010
Nothing's impossible!

00:07.010 --> 00:10.830
You must rehab your mind among the Midarezaki!

00:10.830 --> 00:16.950
But before the Operation Cozy Family starts,
every human being went through DNA analysis.

00:16.950 --> 00:19.660
So there's no possibility of me being the Child of Enka.

00:19.660 --> 00:21.870
You give up on things too easily.

01:46.330 --> 01:48.540
Practicality is a rule that exists in the normal world.

01:48.540 --> 01:50.910
Unfortunately, it isn't enough to limit the Midarezaki.

01:50.910 --> 01:52.880
Parties only happen when you allow yourself to go nuts.

02:10.410 --> 02:12.220
Good day.

02:11.360 --> 02:13.820
Good day.

02:12.220 --> 02:13.020
PLACEHOLDER

02:13.020 --> 02:13.820
Onee-sama.

02:13.820 --> 02:15.310
Good day.

02:17.690 --> 02:19.320
Good day.

02:19.980 --> 02:22.330
Good day. Good day.

02:24.680 --> 02:26.630
Momo-san, Shizu-chan, Hi-chan?!

02:26.630 --> 02:28.830
Good day, Onee-sama.

02:28.830 --> 02:30.340
Who are you calling Onee-sama?

02:30.340 --> 02:33.720
My little sisters are a cute, shy,
elementary school girl and an alien jellyfish!

02:33.720 --> 02:35.360
What are you talking about, Onee-sama?

02:35.360 --> 02:36.680
You are our Onee-sama.

02:36.680 --> 02:39.420
Please treat us little kitty cats.

02:39.420 --> 02:41.680
What kind of setting is that?!

02:41.680 --> 02:46.400
Rather than that, Onee-sama,
there's something I wanted to let you know.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.290
Again?

02:47.290 --> 02:48.550
"Again"?!

02:48.550 --> 02:51.770
What do you mean, "Again"?

02:50.220 --> 02:52.310
S-Sorry, nothing.

03:02.840 --> 03:06.790
Huh? Seven students are absent from school with unknown reasons?

03:08.490 --> 03:09.590
That's all?

03:10.290 --> 03:12.160
It's more than "that's all"!

03:12.160 --> 03:16.100
This Gojyu Hissatsu Academy has politeness, commitment, love, and generosity as its tenets!

03:16.100 --> 03:17.130
I-It does?

03:17.840 --> 03:20.380
Our students don't skip school unless it's a real emergency.

03:20.380 --> 03:22.680
Even if they did, they would always report the reason.

03:23.320 --> 03:25.740
Yet, we have seven absent without a reason.

03:25.740 --> 03:28.300
This is a mystery.

03:28.300 --> 03:31.190
Um, Momo-san. Even so, why do you bring this matter to me?

03:32.490 --> 03:34.980
W-Why you ask?

03:35.900 --> 03:38.500
Hey, hey, hey, hey, Onee-sama!

03:38.500 --> 03:43.350
I won't let you claim you forgot what happened the day you transferred here!

03:43.350 --> 03:44.410
That was-

03:57.250 --> 04:01.470
You beat me and became the top of this school.

04:01.470 --> 04:05.590
The leader has an obligation to protect the students' safety!

04:02.210 --> 04:05.070
I don't remember becoming something like that...

04:06.580 --> 04:10.270
Anyway, we're sure something's going on.

04:10.270 --> 04:16.100
The girls absent all say they don't want to go to school and won't take a single step from their rooms.

04:16.100 --> 04:18.640
Are you not going to do anything about it?

04:18.640 --> 04:20.830
One of them is Hijiri's best friend.

04:20.830 --> 04:21.680
Hi-chan's?

04:21.680 --> 04:23.360
Please do something about it, Onee-sama.

04:23.360 --> 04:24.470
Is what you just said true?

04:25.260 --> 04:29.620
Yes, it's true, but, Onee-sama... Um...

04:35.070 --> 04:38.630
Mari-cchi, my best friend has perfect health that anyone would admire.

04:38.630 --> 04:44.380
She was called "Earth Eater" since she probably would eat the ground if it tasted good.

04:44.940 --> 04:47.720
Just hearing the nickname makes her sound really strong.

04:47.720 --> 04:51.850
And that Mari-cchi is not eating anything
and has locked herself in her room for three days!

04:51.850 --> 04:55.480
Even when I try talking to her, she gets angry saying, "I can't live on with this face!"

04:56.230 --> 05:01.670
I even heard the people at the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures are looking into it.

05:01.670 --> 05:03.230
Yes, that is strange.

05:03.230 --> 05:04.000
Isn't it?!

05:04.000 --> 05:05.200
So please, Onee-sama!

05:07.650 --> 05:09.460
Thank you for your help!

05:09.460 --> 05:12.160
We won't forgive you if you step down!

05:12.160 --> 05:14.340
This is exactly what I want...

05:14.340 --> 05:19.280
I'm free from Himemiya and thought I could finally have a peaceful school life,

05:19.280 --> 05:22.550
but they keep calling me Boss and Onee-sama and whatnot...

05:25.740 --> 05:26.780
But...

05:27.380 --> 05:29.890
Onee-sama, we love you!

05:29.890 --> 05:32.890
Onee-sama! Onee-sama!

05:41.140 --> 05:43.380
It's ready, everyone.

05:43.380 --> 05:46.240
Tonight's Virgo's special, rice omelet with gravy.

05:46.240 --> 05:48.750
Yes, I've been waiting!

05:47.250 --> 05:48.750
Wow! It looks delicious.

05:48.750 --> 05:51.740
Hey! That biggest one is Kyouka-sama's!

05:50.240 --> 05:51.740
Stop it Kyouka. You're being rude.

05:52.410 --> 05:55.250
"Can't live with this face", eh?

05:55.680 --> 06:02.970
If the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures is taking action, then some abnormal force is at work, right?

06:03.750 --> 06:06.390
Quit it, Ouka!

06:04.410 --> 06:07.830
Yes, Chika-san. Is there something on my face?

06:07.830 --> 06:08.760
N-No. Nothing.

06:08.760 --> 06:10.730
You come over here, too.

06:10.730 --> 06:15.610
Otherwise I'll eat all the rice omelets with gravy,
pretty good for a gay bar specialty.

06:16.430 --> 06:17.930
Kyouka, wait!

06:17.930 --> 06:21.860
I made a lot, so enjoy yourselves.

06:18.640 --> 06:21.860
By the way, how is your new school going?

06:21.860 --> 06:23.080
"H-How?"

06:23.080 --> 06:25.200
When you need help, ask for anything.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.950
I'll help you out.

06:28.890 --> 06:30.040
Kitty...

06:31.000 --> 06:33.850
No, this is my problem.

06:44.080 --> 06:45.700
Good day, Onee-sama!

06:45.700 --> 06:47.970
Yes. This is my problem.

06:47.970 --> 06:49.590
I must deal with it myself.

06:51.970 --> 06:54.050
We have two more people absent today!

06:54.050 --> 06:56.570
That makes nine solely from our school.

06:57.270 --> 06:58.420
"Solely from our school?"

06:58.420 --> 07:07.560
Yeah. I used the Momokusa network to check. The same case is spreading through the area.

07:07.560 --> 07:11.110
I see. It looks like this really is more than just a simple case of ditching school.

07:14.410 --> 07:16.040
What the hell are you guys?
If you have some business, then-

07:19.430 --> 07:20.500
Momokusa-san!

07:21.960 --> 07:22.610
Momo-san!

07:22.610 --> 07:24.100
Midarezaki Chika.

07:24.100 --> 07:25.680
W-Who are you guys?!

07:25.680 --> 07:29.340
We are Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures 1st Counter Department.

07:30.620 --> 07:34.140
Midarezaki Chika. Come with us.

07:36.440 --> 07:38.370
D-Don't treat me so roughly.

07:38.370 --> 07:42.700
So you know, we are here to ask you questions with the permission of the Bureau,

07:42.700 --> 07:49.570
and even you, participating in Operation Cozy Family,
have no rights to be uncooperative.

07:49.570 --> 07:50.320
Huh?

07:50.320 --> 07:51.860
What is this all about?

07:51.860 --> 07:55.610
Unfortunately, I don't know anything about what's going on in this school.

07:55.610 --> 07:57.370
Shut up, Child of Enka!

07:57.370 --> 08:00.790
You monster. It gives me the creeps just to have you guys around.

08:02.380 --> 08:07.830
The issue is that this case started after you enrolled at this school.

08:07.830 --> 08:09.040
That's all!

08:09.040 --> 08:15.140
Remember this. Not everyone at the Bureau is in favor of Operation Cozy Family.

08:16.810 --> 08:18.960
You're this world's cancer cells.

08:18.960 --> 08:21.080
Family Frenzy shouldn't exist.

08:21.080 --> 08:24.520
If you all die, this world will be at peace!

08:21.940 --> 08:23.020
No!

08:25.850 --> 08:27.240
Pierre-san?

08:27.240 --> 08:29.860
Chika-sama. How are you doing?

08:28.850 --> 08:29.860
Who are you?!

08:29.860 --> 08:31.190
Pierre-san, run!

08:31.190 --> 08:33.860
Go get someone!

08:42.920 --> 08:48.290
I don't need to go get someone. We can handle this.

08:49.790 --> 08:51.270
Allow me to introduce you.

08:51.270 --> 08:55.880
This is a citizen of the People's Republic of Kyouka. Curious Itou-san.

08:59.550 --> 09:02.230
Long time no see, Chika-sama.

09:02.230 --> 09:03.680
Pierre-san...

09:03.680 --> 09:08.730
Are they with you? They look like they're from the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures.

09:08.730 --> 09:11.220
No. They are enemies, so it was all right for you to beat them up.

09:11.220 --> 09:12.070
I see.

09:12.740 --> 09:18.010
In that case, looks like what Hanayama-sama was worried about has happened.

09:18.010 --> 09:18.780
Hanayama?

09:20.030 --> 09:22.690
You're not familiar with the name?

09:22.690 --> 09:27.670
Hanayama-sama is the Vice-Head of the Bureau.

09:27.670 --> 09:31.610
I came here at his command.

09:32.710 --> 09:36.450
Something's going on at the
Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures.

09:36.450 --> 09:42.950
Those who are opposed to Operation Cozy Family are gaining support, and some of them came to your school.

09:42.950 --> 09:44.350
I see...

09:57.530 --> 09:59.200
Please eat up.

09:59.200 --> 10:00.950
Itadakimasu!

10:01.030 --> 10:02.740
It's delicious!

10:02.740 --> 10:04.380
It's so good.

10:04.380 --> 10:06.010
As expected from Pierre-dono.

10:06.010 --> 10:09.000
I'm sorry to say this, but it's incomparably better than what Honored Brother makes.

10:09.000 --> 10:11.420
You're so mean. Take it back!

10:11.420 --> 10:15.740
If I can eat this, then you're welcome here anytime, Pierre!

10:15.740 --> 10:18.620
I don't think we can just welcome him.

10:18.620 --> 10:20.680
If the news Pierre-san told us are true...

10:20.680 --> 10:22.390
You mean about those who are opposed to Operation Cozy Family?

10:23.390 --> 10:26.300
It's a big operation they invested so much in.

10:26.300 --> 10:28.880
It's not a surprise that several people are against the idea.

10:28.880 --> 10:33.110
But rest assured. As a most wonderful fact,
I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

10:33.110 --> 10:35.450
Teika and I are here, too, so it'll be fine.

10:35.450 --> 10:38.240
I won't let them close to my family.

10:38.240 --> 10:40.110
Yay! Thank you, Teika-kun.

10:42.640 --> 10:44.080
But I'm...

10:44.080 --> 10:45.790
Forget that, let's keep eating!

10:45.790 --> 10:47.770
Pierre! Keep the food coming!

10:47.770 --> 10:48.960
Right away.

11:03.430 --> 11:05.190
I'm a fake.

11:05.190 --> 11:06.860
I'm not really part of that family.

11:06.860 --> 11:08.480
I can't do anything alone.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.360
What's wrong?

11:10.400 --> 11:13.270
Did the presence of the opposition faction scare you?

11:14.760 --> 11:18.840
Do you regret me forcing you into the Family Frenzy?

11:19.440 --> 11:22.140
N-No. I was just...

11:22.140 --> 11:25.720
You're angry at yourself for not being able to help your classmates, right?

11:30.170 --> 11:36.710
I can imagine. While you're part of
the Family Frenzy, you alone are a normal human.

11:37.140 --> 11:40.190
Even so, you are part of the Family Frenzy.

11:43.670 --> 11:45.390
You are my daughter.

11:49.100 --> 11:50.570
Kitty...

11:50.570 --> 11:52.980
Call me Mother, you grey hair!

11:56.030 --> 11:59.210
You don't have to be so stubborn and suffer alone.

11:59.210 --> 12:02.950
I told you to ask for help if you need it, you stupid daughter.

12:06.570 --> 12:08.680
If you're having trouble, then lean on me.

12:08.680 --> 12:10.950
That's what mothers are for.

12:28.970 --> 12:30.980
Onee-sama!

12:32.390 --> 12:34.900
We have a problem! Momokusa-san is...

12:36.020 --> 12:39.120
What? Even Momo-san is absent from school?

12:39.120 --> 12:41.570
Wh-What is her family saying?

12:41.570 --> 12:44.980
No matter how many times we call, they just hang up on us!

12:44.980 --> 12:48.370
Momokusa-san accepted us, who were so juvenile,

12:48.370 --> 12:53.580
and when she found out her brother was sick, she went and found a doctor and even paid the expensive bills.

12:53.580 --> 12:58.590
If anything were to happen to Momokusa-san, what should we do, Onee-sama?!

12:58.590 --> 13:01.390
D-Don't ask me what to do.

13:02.570 --> 13:04.420
The sky calls, the Earth calls, Chika calls.

13:04.420 --> 13:06.340
She calls the God in search of assistance.

13:07.690 --> 13:10.350
Kitty. What are you doing there?

13:10.350 --> 13:14.740
What else could I have done! In this small confessional, this is the only available space!

13:14.740 --> 13:16.850
Rather than that, you're calling me "Kitty" again?

13:16.850 --> 13:18.000
Well, who cares.

13:18.000 --> 13:20.090
Chika, you're facing a problem now, aren't you?

13:20.790 --> 13:23.670
You are, and you wish for help, right?

13:23.670 --> 13:24.740
W-Well, that's...

13:24.740 --> 13:28.870
Very well! Then this great detective shall help you.

13:28.870 --> 13:32.600
Consider yourself to be riding Noah's Arc and leave everything to me, dear Watson!

13:32.600 --> 13:33.290
Watson?

13:33.290 --> 13:35.030
Good work.

13:35.030 --> 13:36.180
Listen, Chika.

13:36.180 --> 13:41.570
In cases like this, discovering the cause is the very basic.

13:41.570 --> 13:45.160
For this case, it's crucial to find out why the students are absent.

13:45.160 --> 13:45.800
"Why?"

13:45.800 --> 13:49.220
In other words, it's easiest to meet the person and ask her!

13:49.220 --> 13:51.100
Everyone, follow me!

13:51.600 --> 13:54.420
Where's your purpose in hiding?!

13:54.420 --> 13:55.620
Um, Onee-sama.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.140
Is she someone you know?

13:57.140 --> 13:59.490
A-Anyway, we need to follow her!

14:00.230 --> 14:01.980
This is getting interesting!

14:01.980 --> 14:03.280
Time for a party!

14:04.150 --> 14:05.990
Please wait, Onee-sama!

14:05.990 --> 14:06.950
Onee-sama!

14:15.290 --> 14:19.480
Strange. Since when did this town smell like animals so much?

14:22.440 --> 14:23.650
What to do...

14:23.650 --> 14:25.010
What is the problem?

14:26.450 --> 14:30.480
Why, look at that.
You must be the descendant of the Bister Kings.

14:30.480 --> 14:32.440
It is an honor to meet you.

14:32.440 --> 14:34.420
You know about us?

14:34.420 --> 14:37.940
I got myself lost here.

14:38.550 --> 14:42.230
I know my destination is here in this town.

14:42.230 --> 14:45.140
Wait, would you possibly be Midarezaki Teika?

14:45.140 --> 14:47.570
And who might you be to know that?

14:47.570 --> 14:52.230
Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures Vice-Head, Hanayama Genichirou.

14:52.230 --> 14:56.120
This is perfect. My destination is your house, Teika-kun.

15:05.850 --> 15:07.670
Momo-san's house is...

15:07.670 --> 15:10.940
Yes. They're the yakuza that control this area.

15:10.940 --> 15:14.090
Momokusa-san is the heir of the troops.

15:14.090 --> 15:15.430
I-It all makes sense.

15:15.430 --> 15:19.220
Um, so how do you intend to get in?

15:19.220 --> 15:22.730
You think I would come this far without a plan?

15:22.730 --> 15:25.250
Leave everything to this omnipotent and omniscient god!

15:27.230 --> 15:29.240
Look at this ninja skill, Breakthrough!

15:28.050 --> 15:30.570
How do you call this a plan?!

15:29.240 --> 15:30.570
Follow me, my army!

15:30.570 --> 15:32.050
Since when are we an army?

15:32.050 --> 15:33.410
Get them!

15:33.410 --> 15:36.740
You think bullets like that will hit me?

15:36.990 --> 15:39.200
Ninja skill: Shadow Clone!

15:40.040 --> 15:42.330
Wow, she's awesome!

15:42.330 --> 15:44.210
We can't stop now.

15:44.210 --> 15:45.510
Shizu-chan! Hi-chan!

15:45.510 --> 15:46.710
Yes Ma'am!

15:46.710 --> 15:49.130
Hey, where's Momokusa-san?

15:49.130 --> 15:52.590
Tell us or you'll suffer.

15:52.590 --> 15:58.140
Exactly. Don't forget the school tenet. Always be polite.

16:02.520 --> 16:04.730
So she's there! Good job, Gekka!

16:11.240 --> 16:13.670
What is this place? I can't see anything.

16:13.670 --> 16:15.460
Where are you, Momokusa-san?

16:15.460 --> 16:17.740
Answer us if you're here.

16:16.110 --> 16:17.740
Momo-san!

16:17.740 --> 16:20.750
Note: Seals against Evil

16:17.740 --> 16:20.140
Hijiri. Shizuka. Is Onee-sama there, too?

16:20.750 --> 16:21.890
Momokusa-san!

16:21.890 --> 16:23.080
So you were safe.

16:23.080 --> 16:23.900
Don't come!

16:28.660 --> 16:34.390
I'm sorry. I'm happy that you all came,
but I can't let you guys see me like this.

16:34.390 --> 16:35.960
"See me like this"?

16:35.960 --> 16:38.100
I'm sorry but don't say anything and go home.

16:38.100 --> 16:42.710
W-What's this? This isn't like you at all!

16:42.710 --> 16:45.280
Is there something wrong with your appearance?

16:45.280 --> 16:49.000
We don't care what you look like.

16:49.000 --> 16:49.930
Neither would I!

16:49.930 --> 16:52.330
Not to brag, but I'm used to seeing strange people.

16:52.330 --> 16:53.580
No, but I'm...

16:54.280 --> 16:56.720
Forget it! Gekka!

17:04.460 --> 17:09.730
See what I mean?! You shouldn't have seen me and just left!

17:09.730 --> 17:12.630
Oh my gosh! You're so cute, Momokusa-san!

17:12.630 --> 17:15.590
You're so cute! What a cute kitty cat!

17:16.320 --> 17:18.760
You guys don't find me scary?

17:18.760 --> 17:21.370
No. I love animals.

17:21.370 --> 17:25.560
I've always wanted to pet a human-sized cat.

17:25.560 --> 17:27.230
That's not the problem here!

17:27.230 --> 17:29.260
You're copying my character setting!

17:29.260 --> 17:29.910
You're violating copyright law!

17:29.910 --> 17:31.150
And violating right to one's likeness, too!

17:31.600 --> 17:34.330
But now we're starting to see the problem.

17:34.330 --> 17:39.440
Maybe the same thing is happening to all the other absent students.

17:39.440 --> 17:44.370
You're right. Normally, no one would want to be seen if they've become an animal.

17:44.370 --> 17:46.250
How did this happen anyway?

17:46.250 --> 17:49.380
I bet someone just wanted to copy me!

17:49.380 --> 17:54.710
I bet someone's planning to change all humans to lovable pet forms!

17:51.050 --> 17:54.710
No... um... that's...

17:54.710 --> 17:57.970
I never imagined such a thing.

17:59.510 --> 18:01.800
Which yakuza group are you guys?

18:01.000 --> 18:01.800
Pops?

18:01.800 --> 18:04.720
I bet you guys are after our drugs.

18:05.300 --> 18:06.020
Drugs?

18:06.020 --> 18:08.020
Pops, what is this about?

18:08.020 --> 18:09.860
It's nothing major.

18:09.860 --> 18:17.030
We developed a drug as a new income source, and we've spread it through the city via food to test its effects.

18:18.020 --> 18:22.910
But it looks like it had a side-effect of changing humans to animals.

18:23.650 --> 18:27.910
I never imagined such an ugly animal would come from us.

18:27.910 --> 18:28.720
Aichi!

18:28.720 --> 18:30.960
You're a shame to the Momokusa troops!

18:30.960 --> 18:31.760
You're horrible!

18:31.760 --> 18:33.240
Yeah! Look how cute she is!

18:34.350 --> 18:36.180
You did this knowing all of this was happening?

18:36.180 --> 18:39.380
If we can make money from it,
I don't care what happens to others.

18:39.380 --> 18:42.600
I'm really thankful to Dr. Gebok for developing the drug.

18:43.320 --> 18:44.760
Dr. Gebok?

18:44.760 --> 18:48.520
I knew something was strange.
So that fake scientist was behind all of this, eh?

18:48.930 --> 18:52.600
You've learned too much. You won't get out alive.

18:52.600 --> 18:56.530
You're the one that spilled everything. How does your brain work?

18:56.530 --> 18:58.870
Stop it Pops! They're my-

18:58.220 --> 19:00.860
Shut up! Do you want to turn into a beehive, as well?

19:00.860 --> 19:04.780
You're scum who doesn't think of your daughter as your child!

19:04.780 --> 19:07.950
You have made this Kyouka-sama truly mad!

19:07.950 --> 19:09.910
What do you think you can do?

19:09.910 --> 19:11.180
You fool!

19:11.180 --> 19:15.400
You think a bullet would reach the god who reigns above the clouds?

19:15.400 --> 19:16.630
Let's try it!

19:25.630 --> 19:27.170
Who are you?!

19:30.180 --> 19:31.440
Don't stare at me like that.

19:31.440 --> 19:32.760
I'm not your enemy.

19:32.760 --> 19:34.150
I saved you, didn't I?

19:34.150 --> 19:35.450
Saved us?

19:35.450 --> 19:40.780
Yeah. You might not be afraid of guns, but what of those behind you?

19:41.800 --> 19:46.660
I figured it'd be difficult fighting while protecting them.

19:46.830 --> 19:48.490
"I never asked for it",

19:48.490 --> 19:51.460
is what I would want to say, but you're right.

19:51.460 --> 19:53.620
So thanks, Dekamelon!

19:53.620 --> 19:54.000
Deka...!

19:54.840 --> 19:56.850
Dekamelon?! Who are you calling Dekamelon?

19:56.850 --> 19:58.800
My name is-

19:57.550 --> 19:58.800
Shut up, Dekamelon!

19:59.110 --> 20:02.150
Listen! It's "deka", in other words, a cop's duty to come in late!

20:02.150 --> 20:04.970
And your green head reminds me of a melon!

20:04.970 --> 20:07.680
So deka plus melon equals Dekamelon!

20:07.680 --> 20:11.560
I-I never knew there was such a rule!

20:11.560 --> 20:13.050
As long as you understand.

20:13.050 --> 20:15.050
It's a name I gave you.

20:15.050 --> 20:17.600
Pass it on down through your family and take pride in it.

20:17.600 --> 20:19.670
Your child will be Dekamelon II.

20:19.670 --> 20:21.400
Your grandchild will be Dekamelon III.

20:21.400 --> 20:25.320
Um, Kitty. Shouldn't we worry about getting out of here right now?

20:25.930 --> 20:26.910
You're right.

20:26.910 --> 20:31.720
Hey, Dekamelon! Because you appeared, things got complicated here!

20:28.770 --> 20:31.360
No! Listen! My name is-!

20:31.720 --> 20:32.710
I shouldn't have saved you.

20:32.710 --> 20:35.710
Step back. I'll let you out of here right now.

20:42.370 --> 20:43.220
Momo-san, hurry!

20:43.220 --> 20:45.380
Wait. I can't go out there like this.

20:45.380 --> 20:47.640
It's not time to be saying that.

20:47.640 --> 20:51.470
Do you have any idea how much Shizu-chan and Hi-chan were worried about you?

20:51.470 --> 20:52.890
Momokusa-san!

20:52.890 --> 20:55.230
Come with us, kitty cat.

20:55.230 --> 20:57.440
Hijiri... Shizuka...

20:57.440 --> 20:58.650
Momokusa-san...

20:58.650 --> 20:59.480
Kitty cat...

21:00.500 --> 21:03.490
Eat...

21:06.360 --> 21:10.600
Eat...

21:11.000 --> 21:17.170
Eat... Just like animals do...

21:14.290 --> 21:15.890
What's wrong, Momo?

21:17.900 --> 21:19.920
Eat...

21:21.970 --> 21:22.880
That's...

21:22.880 --> 21:27.920
Eat... Just like animals do...

21:28.100 --> 21:29.350
Ciao.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.220
What?!

21:31.100 --> 21:36.090
She's back. And as the Head of the Bureau of all things.

21:36.090 --> 21:37.210
No way!

21:37.210 --> 21:43.910
The world's greatest traitor and the Paranormal Phenomena Bureau of Measures's greatest mistake is?

21:45.380 --> 21:47.200
Even a death sentence wasn't enough.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.530
The empire's terrorist.

21:52.120 --> 21:54.000
Hiratsuka Raichou!

21:57.580 --> 22:00.330
It's dangerous. That woman's dangerous.

22:01.710 --> 22:03.960
The fun's only begun.

22:03.960 --> 22:06.930
It's showtime!

23:40.770 --> 23:43.670
Oh no! Oh no! Humans are turning into animals.

23:43.670 --> 23:44.930
It's not even a full moon.

23:44.930 --> 23:47.520
At times like this, we need silver crosses and silver bullets?

23:47.520 --> 23:49.930
No, Yuuka, I think those are the wrong things.

23:50.530 --> 23:53.690
Next time! Electric-Butterfly!
